  "rules": {
    "identity": "uid and WeChat OpenID are server-only; identity-shaped client fields are rejected recursively",
    "upload": "the server issues an opaque user-scoped cloudPath and parse only accepts the exact registered object path",
    "money": "source decimal text is converted to minor-unit decimal strings without JavaScript floating point",
    "evidence": "files, per-file parse batches, FinanceUpdate, Evidence, EconomicEvent, Relation, ReviewIssue, FinanceAction and formal Transaction remain separate; issue.subject.primaryEvidence includes masked original paymentMethod and optional source status for account confirmation",
    "parseUpgrade": "same unposted file bytes reuse a batch only for an equal parse-run-v2 fingerprint; changed parser or interpretation versions append a batch and preserve prior evidence. A core interpretation change may reuse an identity only with the same file digest, source locator, identity anchor digest and unchanged amount/currency/direction; conflicts from other file bytes remain blocked",
    "organization": "same amount, nearby time or similar text creates candidates only; only a stable shared reference plus compatible core fields may auto-merge evidence",
    "postability": "ready is server-derived after planning, every issue resolution and inside the posting transaction; clients cannot submit ready",
    "posting": "one FinanceUpdate commits all ready formal transactions and evidence links in one MySQL transaction; one aggregate repayment EconomicEvent may project to multiple formal transfers only when positive unique liability-account allocations exactly conserve the event amount; any failure rolls the whole update back",
    "cashBalance": "atomic posting may not create or deepen a negative cash balance; failure rolls back accounts, mappings, transactions, links and state together",
    "prePostingWriteBarrier": "before financeUpdates.post, account creation and reusable mapping changes remain FinanceUpdate-scoped drafts; abandoning or a failed post leaves formal accounts, mappings, transactions, balances and reports unchanged",
    "paymentRules": "recognized atomic payment methods may map to one account or be permanently ignored per user and source; an aggregate statement reference such as Alipay 花呗｜信用购 is never an account or reusable mapping and must be allocated to real liability accounts; temporary ignore never silently becomes a permanent rule",
    "lifecycle": "Files and parse batches preserve source evidence. Replacing or abandoning an unposted FinanceUpdate atomically removes its derived events, evidence links, relations, review issues/members and account/mapping drafts, while retaining update/source summaries and action audit. Formal accounts, transactions, reusable mappings and source identities are unchanged. Storage-object cleanup remains best-effort.",
    "publicWritePath": "The only posting implementation is financeUpdates.post. Legacy single-file services and their decision/posting/link tables are removed by migration 0012.",
    "idempotentReplay": "导入命令固定小型首次回执；幂等键/请求摘要持久保留。重复请求不重做，摘要另读。旧在途请求只核实原键，历史事实不足明确待核对；一次性离线转换不构成在线旧协议适配。"
  },
